OL,3,GNEWSACrash victim pressed buttons to
OL,4,Asurge speed - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman accused of killing her friend
OL,7,Fby driving a supercar dangerously has
OL,8,Fclaimed the passenger pressed buttons
OL,9,Fthat caused the car to "surge" in speed
OL,10,Fbefore the fatal crash on the M62.
OL,12,FHumaira Batool, from Bradford, is on
OL,13,Ftrial at Leeds Crown Court after
OL,14,Fdenying causing the death of her
OL,15,Ffriend, 20-year-old Mohammed Shaan
OL,16,FHussain, in the early hours of 21
OL,17,FDecember 2022.
OL,19,FBatool was behind the wheel of a
OL,20,FLamborghini Urus, hired by Hussain,
OL,21,Fbefore it struck a barrier and set
OL,22,Falight near Ripponden.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
