OL,3,GNEWSACrash victim pressed buttons to
OL,4,Asurge speed - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FBatool, who was 22 at the time, told
OL,7,Fthe court Hussain had been fiddling
OL,8,Fwith controls on the car in the lead up
OL,9,Fto the crash, causing the speed to
OL,10,Frapidly rapidly "boost" as she was
OL,11,Fdriving.
